How this retelling is arranged\par
The three source files are consecutive fragments of one Grade 5 textbook for the course \u8220?Foundations of the Spiritual and Moral Culture of the Peoples of Russia.\u8221? The material below follows the same order: first the introduction and a discussion of culture; then moral values, labor, and intellect; and finally aesthetics and religious art. The textbook\u8217?s assignments, diagrams, and illustrations are not reproduced. Only the meaning of the chapters and the logic of the course are given.\par
